      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "In JavaScript, console.log() displays whatever content is placed inside its parentheses ()."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "In the previous program, console.log(\"Hello, World!\") displays the text Hello, World!."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The quotation marks (\" \") around the text are necessary for JavaScript to recognize it as a text."
